WEBVTT

00:03.280 --> 00:04.680
Fire arrows

00:06.240 --> 00:06.920
Archers

00:07.000 --> 00:08.400
Follow my orders

00:11.000 --> 00:12.400
Fire arrows

00:17.640 --> 00:19.040
Fire arrows

00:22.280 --> 00:23.640
No!

00:30.640 --> 00:32.040
Move forward

00:32.800 --> 00:34.400
No retreat, retreat and die

00:38.680 --> 00:40.320
Archers, ready

00:47.800 --> 00:50.600
The northern expedition may one day succeed

00:50.960 --> 00:53.440
But they will never see it

00:54.120 --> 00:55.840
The stench of blood rises beneath the walls

00:55.920 --> 00:57.520
You feel your throat tighten

00:57.600 --> 00:58.720
Your stomach churns

00:58.800 --> 01:01.467
But you remain standing on the city walls

01:01.920 --> 01:02.840
You know

01:02.920 --> 01:06.640
You will never forget this day for the rest of your life

01:06.720 --> 01:08.720
When we finally defeat the Wuzhao

01:08.840 --> 01:10.920
You will repay them a hundredfold

01:11.800 --> 01:13.200
Fire arrows

01:46.560 --> 01:48.000
Fire arrows

01:49.500 --> 01:58.500
Wu Junren drove waves of displaced refugees against the city walls for three days straight. The defending troops atop the walls showed no mercy, and the corpses of the refugees mingled with dirt and stones, piling into a marsh of flesh and blood beneath the city walls...

